==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Osamu Mikumo & Cat (Rare Cat)|Osamu Mikumo & Cat]], [[Yuma Kuga & Cat (Rare Cat)|Yuma Kuga & Cat]] and [[Chika Amatori & Cat (Special Cat)|Chika Amatori & Cat]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[Marmod]] (100%) spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Marmod]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Marmod]]s (100%) spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Marmod]]s (100%) spawn after 1 second<sup>30f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Due to the lack of available units at your disposal, your only option is to bring your World Trigger units. An attack UP [[Cat Combo]] or two will mean you breeze through this stage.

